WEBVTT

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:08.790
"Do you remember that promise?
Or am I the only one?" That's what I thought.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.580
The "shine" we both saw that day...

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:14.910
Fate and enchantment...

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.160
The future and persistence.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.370
But you did remember.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:30.000
I'd lost everything through my own foolishness,
but I was allowed to be reborn, as a Stage Girl...

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:34.000
so the two of us could do "Starlight."

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:36.410
And so...

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:43.700
And so, the final day of auditions has come.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:56.120
Revue Starlight

00:00:56.540 --> 00:01:04.910
Ano hoshi o tsukamu no wa daare?
Who, oh who, will be the one to grab hold of the star?

00:01:05.450 --> 00:01:11.870
Tou no choujou de
At the very top of that tower

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:26.250
Shizuka ni tomotta honou ga atsuku mune o kogashite iku
These flames lit in silence fill my chest with a white-hot passion

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:28.500
Unmei no wa
That's just the Wheel of Fortune

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:36.160
Butai no ue de odorasareteiru wake ja nai
It's not like I'm being forced to dance on this stage

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.370
Tobitate
Spring forth

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:42.250
Tashika ni ano hi mitanda
I'm sure I saw it that day

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:45.910
Hajiketa hoshi no kirameki
The brilliance of a star that has burst open

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:52.370
Iroaseta yakusoku ni yubi ga fureru made
Until my fingers reach out to touch that faded promise

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:56.450
Makuake mae ni hajimaru
It will start before the curtain rises

00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:00.000
Me no mae de tsuzurareteku
And be spelled out before our eyes

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.580
Umarekawatta watashi wa
Having been reborn

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:07.410
Koko de kimi ni aeta
I was able to meet you here

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:11.040
Mou ichido
Once again

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:18.750
Auditions
Final Day

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:18.330
The final day of auditions, huh?

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:22.120
These things always come out of the blue...

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.660
The one who passes gets to decide...

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.910
And the new stage of fate will begin.

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:37.540
"Everyone can perform magic,
everyone can reach his goals, if he is able to think."

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:41.830
Hermann Hesse said that, right?

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:43.580
Bana-nice!

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:48.330
Oh. Yeah, you're right.

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:51.500
We have to give our all, right to the end...

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:53.540
And aim for that Star.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.950
And as a Stage Girl, I'll keep going right to the-

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.330
It's like, it was all over before we knew it, huh?

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:13.950
The day's finally come... I'm gonna be the Top Star.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:16.450
If anyone, it's going to be me.

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.160
Futaba...

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:20.200
How many wins have you gotten?

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:22.370
How many have you?

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:24.040
That's a secret.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.160
Then it's a secret for me too.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:32.330
Yeah, well... There's no point in thinking about it now.

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:36.830
That's right. All we can do is keep
going the way we have.

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:43.870
Did you beat Tendo?

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.450
I told you, it's a secret.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:54.330
The last day... The last day of auditions!

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:58.120
Karen-chan, you're spilling crumbs all over the place.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:02.250
What do I do? What should I do now?

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:06.330
Oh, no! Not you too, Hikari-chan!

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.000
Both of you, get out of here!

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.200
Huh?

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:15.660
It's the last day of auditions, so I want to get
my emotions and my room in order.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.290
Okay, then I'll help!

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:19.660
Me too.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.500
You'll just make a bigger mess, so no thank you!

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.330
And neither of you come back here for a while!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.160
So, what now?

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.250
Yeah, what now...?

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:40.830
I remembered a promise I made!

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:41.870
A promise?

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:43.160
Let's go!

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:45.000
Wait!

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.790
Okay, then! I'll get started.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:05.580
She's here...

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.200
You are a truly infuriating woman.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.950
Wherever I go, there you are.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:23.200
And what if we're thinking the same thing?

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:24.830
The same thing?

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:29.290
The 100th Seisho Festival. The next "Starlight."

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:33.290
The determination to try to create something new...

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:36.500
The courage to challenge the unknown...

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.700
The overwhelming intensity of Group B...

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:43.950
Delivering something that equals the passion
of the stagehands... That is...

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:46.660
Nothing matters but the "shine" of the Top Star.

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:00.910
Oh! Was this it?

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:14.590
Tokyo Tower Aquarium

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:14.620
It's open!

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:18.590
Goldfish
scooping
Welcome to
the world
of fish

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:18.620
Is this the promise you meant?

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.500
We promised we'd come here again, right?

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:26.620
Hikari-chan, did you forget?

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:29.950
I remembered. Of course.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:31.370
I knew it!

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:38.160
Something wrong?

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:41.370
I was just thinking... how poorly I've performed.

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:42.370
Sorry?

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.500
You may not remember, but...

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:53.160
At the entrance exams, I asked you
to stretch with me, didn't I?

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:55.790
You were that girl from the theatrical family...

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:59.700
The "Genius Stage Girl," Maya Tendo.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.290
I wanted to see what you could do...

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:07.910
And it blew up in my face.

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:12.790
From my entry ranking to the Seisho Festival,
I was always Number 2.

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:15.660
I really have performed poorly.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:20.200
Yes, I remember that. Of course I do.

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.120
But...

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:27.500
Merci.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.700
They called me the child prodigy,
the top star of the future...

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:37.580
I'd always been so cocky, but you utterly
destroyed me, which let me be reborn.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:43.870
However, I will not lose.

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:46.910
I'll become the Top Star...

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:50.450
and prove I'm more than just your supporting role.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:54.830
I look forward to it... Claudine Saijo.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.330
You truly are infuriating.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:04.120
It's like, it's changed but it also hasn't!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:08.540
And yet, it's already been 12 years, huh?

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:11.250
Since we bought these here and traded them...

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.620
Hikari-chan! Look, over there!

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:29.870
This part hasn't changed at all.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:37.750
It's as if we've been together forever!

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.910
Let's meet here again next year!

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.540
On the night of the Star Festival!

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.830
Just like that day... Right, Hikari-chan?

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:55.910
On the way home from that show we saw,
the two of us did our own performance of "Starlight"...

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:59.080
Hey, Karen?

00:08:59.080 --> 00:08:59.910
Hm?

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:02.830
Have I changed?

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:06.910
You've never changed, Hikari-chan.

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:10.040
Let's do "Starlight" together, okay?

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:15.410
That's what we promised, and you haven't changed
at all from that day, Hikari-chan!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:22.700
"Let's go! Together, we will grasp that star!"

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:38.200
Ah, that was fun!

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:41.790
Before we knew it, we'd gathered a crowd of people...

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.120
That was kind of embarrassing.

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:45.540
Kind of, huh?

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:54.950
Let's come here again, Hikari-chan.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:56.660
Yeah.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.160
Karen...

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.790
Someday, once again, we'll-

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.450
Hikari-chan. You have a text.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:18.370
Thank you, Karen.

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:23.500
You always remembered our promise.

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:24.750
Huh?

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:29.250
Also, thank you for... always thinking of us.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.620
Hikari-chan?

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.290
That's why...

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:44.120
We're in...

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.450
The audience seats?!

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:49.750
What is the...

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.370
...meaning of this? Well?!

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:55.370
Given the presence of our unofficial participant,

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:59.290
it was necessary to adjust the schedule somewhat.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:04.250
Those whose results suggest they might pass...

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:07.000
comprise you, the top four.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:14.080
And so, for this final day, we will hold
a special two-on-two performance...

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:18.120
The Revue Duet shall now begin!

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:21.000
"Revue... Duet"?

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:22.870
Two-on-two...

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.870
Like, a tag-team match?

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:26.620
Hikari-chan!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:31.000
I knew it... We can both become stars!

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:32.580
Karen...

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:37.410
This is special treatment.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:41.250
Well then, Maya Tendo...

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:48.750
Which Stage Girl do you choose?

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:53.790
You're prepared for this, right?

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:55.040
Oui!

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:02.540
And, Hikari Kagura, which Stage Girl will you choose?

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.660
Karen Aijo!

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:10.420
Intermission
Lunch Box

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:13.120
How kind of you to prepare some lunch boxes...

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:17.910
Kaoruko?

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:22.580
It's a waste to even be here if there's
no chance of becoming the Top Star.

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:24.830
Let's go, Futaba.

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:27.160
I'm gonna stay and watch.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:32.080
I have to see what it is I'm bad at, or I'll never get better.

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:36.290
I'm going to watch, too. I'll watch and practice...

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:40.080
I have to make sure that next time, no one can beat me!

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:44.830
It stings that it's not me on that stage... It stings, but...!

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:47.620
Yeah, I've gotta see this for myself.

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:51.410
I wanna know what stage of fate everyone chooses.

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:02.040
The "Revue Duet"! I understand...

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:09.220
I AM                                              REBORN

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:10.900
No. 99 Trolley Furnace

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:17.450
Sewing Process

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:34.750
Please do not touch

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:37.750
From a hand held confidently aloft...

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:40.410
the flowers of love have so magnificently bloomed.

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.910
Though it may end in tragedy...

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:45.910
I will leap onto that stage of light
to make my appearance!

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:48.660
From the 99th class, Hikari Kagura!

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:51.410
From the 99th class, Karen Aijo!

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.870
We will all do "Starlight" together!

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:59.450
Everyone has an equal chance to shine...

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:02.500
So, through the dance of love,
I shall burn more passionately,

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:05.040
soar on freedom's wings higher than anyone!

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:08.950
I am the second-ranked student of the 99th class,
Claudine Saijo!

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:11.900
It is I,
the star!

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.790
The star of love which shines on the moon...

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:20.330
Now, gather that outpouring of light and
send it to your heart!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:24.200
Head of the 99th class, Maya Tendo!

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:27.700
Tonight, I will show you that "shine"!

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:37.450
The final day of auditions,
the "Revue of Fate," will now commence.

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:44.160
If the jacket of any of you falls, then you shall lose.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:45.950
Well, then...

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:47.450
Let's start!
Ça commence!

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.540
Let's do it, Hikari-chan!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.700
Revue of Fate

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:14.330
I understand... I understand now.

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:17.950
I know how you'll move and how you will leap forward.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.410
The one can accompany you...

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:22.700
The one who can keep up with me...

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:25.080
is you, Claudine Saijo.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:27.250
Maya Tendo...

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.910
How can they shine so brightly?

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:32.000
They're amazing, both of them!

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:33.700
Neither can stand to lose.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:47.910
Karen.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.080
Hikari-chan.

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:56.330
I am reborn!

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.750
Two... can become one.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:18.910
The "shine" has THIS much power?

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.660
Don't write us off just yet!

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:25.040
Together, we'll get that Star!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:30.950
It is the stage that gives me life!

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:36.870
"Glory," you shall stop at the tip of this blade!

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:56.160
Position Zero!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:18:59.200
Hikari-chan.

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:00.750
Yeah.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:05.910
This concludes the Revue Duet!

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:06.870
Wait!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:12.200
I'm the one who lost! It was me only!

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:16.540
Maya Tendo has lost to no one.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:22.290
Maya Tendo... hasn't lost!

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:28.660
Maya... has not lost. My Maya...

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:36.290
There is no way that
my Maya has lost like this!

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:40.540
Maya is not
the loser!

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:42.290
Exactly

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:51.800
I absolutely
have not lost.

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:00.950
Those two...

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:07.200
just had more "Starlight"
than we did in this Revue.

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:10.330
Nothing is lost...
therefore,

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:14.830
Arise, Claudine.

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:21.950
With you, I think I always go
further and higher.

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:28.450
You're cute,
even when you cry... My Claudine.

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:34.980
You are a truly
infuriating woman...

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:34.980
Let's go!

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:48.370
We won... Us, against those two!

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:52.330
In this audition, we're the-!

00:20:58.330 --> 00:20:59.120
What is this?!

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:01.080
The last audition...

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:04.870
the "Revue of Tragedy" will now commence.

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:13.160
Let us compete in song and dance,
and aim to become the Top Star.

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:14.870
Hikari-chan?!

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:17.370
I knew it.

00:21:17.490 --> 00:21:27.650
Revue of Tragedy

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:21.870
Sure enough, only one of us can pass this audition.

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:26.250
We can't both become stars.

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:30.080
I understand.

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:33.790
Thank you... Karen.

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:35.540
Hikari-chan?

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:38.700
You always remembered me.

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:44.750
You stayed with me... Your "shine" illuminated me,
and you helped guide me.

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:50.660
You helped me be reborn and made into a Stage Girl...

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:54.700
and all so that we could both do "Starlight."

00:21:55.450 --> 00:22:01.080
But I can't steal your shine... I can't let it be stolen.

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:02.950
And so, Karen...

00:22:25.750 --> 00:22:26.870
That's why...

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:29.160
this is goodbye.

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:41.790
Watashi zutto anata o miteta

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:45.870
Anata o miteta
Watashi zutto anata o miteta

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:49.910
Kodoku o oite kita mitai

00:22:49.910 --> 00:22:53.290
Kita mitai
Kodoku o oite kita mitai

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:55.870
Koyoi, tsuki mo

00:22:55.870 --> 00:22:57.370
Tsuki mo
Koyoi, tsuki mo

00:22:57.370 --> 00:22:59.410
Waraikakeru

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:01.080
Kaketeru
Waraikakeru

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:04.040
Kotchi o muite

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:09.370
Oh, fly me to the star

00:23:24.200 --> 00:23:27.910
Kimochi tsutaeru koto dekinakute

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:32.250
Koto dekinakute
Kimochi tsutaeru koto dekinakute

