Anata no ki o

00:23:45.870 --> 00:23:47.700
Anata o
Anata no ki o

00:23:47.700 --> 00:23:50.450
Hikitai kara

00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:55.330
Oh, fly me to the star

00:24:00.240 --> 00:24:04.450
Next time,
